#: ../../14-ffi.md:29 7019a0ea28654884b3d5cf4d24c17c3b
msgid "14. OpenResty FFI (Foreign Function Interface)"
msgstr "14. OpenResty FFI（外部函数接口）"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:33 b5c79726748f410fbfdb1c2f8b3d0958
msgid ""
"In OpenResty, FFI (Foreign Function Interface) primarily means **LuaJIT "
"FFI**: it lets Lua code call external C functions and manipulate C data "
"structures directly. Because the classic Nginx Lua API is implemented on top"
" of the standard Lua C API (which stops the just-in-time compiler from "
"optimizing the calls), OpenResty relies heavily on FFI-based rewrites to get"
" maximum performance and avoid JIT-compilation barriers. See "
"[appendix-03-lua](appendix-03-lua.md) for the Lua/LuaJIT fundamentals this "
"page builds on."
msgstr ""
"在 OpenResty 中，FFI（外部函数接口，Foreign Function Interface）主要是指 **LuaJIT FFI**：它让 "
"Lua 代码能直接调用外部 C 函数并操作 C 数据结构。由于经典的 Nginx Lua API 是建立在标准 Lua C API "
"之上（这会阻止即时编译器优化这些调用），OpenResty 大量依赖基于 FFI 的重写来获得最高性能并绕开 JIT 编译障碍。本页所依据的 "
"Lua/LuaJIT 基础见[附录-03 Lua](appendix-03-lua.md)。"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:42 5d9e0ac2d06d41c29e68bd0a809f3a09
msgid "1. lua-resty-core (Built-in FFI Ecosystem)"
msgstr "1. lua-resty-core（内建的 FFI 生态）"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:44 906236fb71cb452ea5e50f1a1024896a
msgid ""
"OpenResty bundles [lua-resty-core](https://github.com/openresty/lua-resty-"
"core) by default. This library re-implements many core Nginx Lua APIs (such "
"as URI parsing, regex, base64 encoding, and shared dictionaries) using "
"LuaJIT FFI."
msgstr ""
"OpenResty 默认捆绑 [lua-resty-core](https://github.com/openresty/lua-resty-"
"core)。该库用 LuaJIT FFI 重新实现了许多核心的 Nginx Lua API（例如 URI 解析、正则、base64 编码和共享字典）。"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:48 6d420d56190e4f749174aa876fa92272
msgid ""
"The benefit: your code can run fully inside LuaJIT's compiled machine code "
"without falling back to the slower interpreted mode, because the rewritten "
"APIs are just FFI calls that the JIT can compile, instead of C-function "
"callbacks that force an interpreter round-trip."
msgstr ""
"好处是：你的代码可以完全运行在 LuaJIT 编译后的机器码中，不必回退到较慢的解释模式——因为重写后的 API 只是 JIT 可编译的 FFI "
"调用，而不是迫使解释器来回切换的 C 函数回调。"

