#: ../../14-ffi.md:72 f22c155bc95f4ea893f504d5c993a7c2
msgid "3. FFI Best Practices in OpenResty"
msgstr "3. OpenResty 中的 FFI 最佳实践"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:74 b46d50fc817c4cc5be6db77c19fd1e98
msgid ""
"When writing high-concurrency code inside Nginx, FFI needs special care:"
msgstr "在 Nginx 内编写高并发代码时，FFI 需要特别小心："

#: ../../14-ffi.md:76 dab4e32793914cc1acbe81ffb22251f3
msgid ""
"**Avoid blocking calls.** Standard C functions are synchronous. Calling a C "
"function that blocks (for example heavy disk I/O or a synchronous network "
"call) freezes the entire Nginx worker thread and destroys OpenResty's "
"asynchronous advantage."
msgstr ""
"**避免阻塞调用。** 标准 C 函数是同步的。调用会阻塞的 C 函数（例如重度的磁盘 I/O 或同步网络调用）会冻结整个 Nginx worker "
"线程，摧毁 OpenResty 的异步优势。"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:80 230f155605724158a354974f6bdf14da
msgid ""
"**Keep `ffi.cdef` at the module (global) level.** Never run `ffi.cdef` "
"inside a request handler such as `content_by_lua_block`; it is a heavyweight"
" initialization operation. Define it at the top of your Lua module so it "
"runs once during the Nginx configuration/loading phase, not per request."
msgstr ""
"**把 `ffi.cdef` 放在模块（全局）级别。** 绝不要在 `content_by_lua_block` 之类的请求处理器里执行 "
"`ffi.cdef`；它是重量级的初始化操作。请在 Lua 模块顶部定义，使它只在 Nginx 配置/加载阶段运行一次，而不是每个请求都执行。"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:84 6b76c05fdf9b4ff684eebd4f14a6110b
msgid ""
"**Manage C memory deliberately.** Be careful with `ffi.new()` allocations. "
"For large structs allocated frequently, rely on LuaJIT's garbage collector, "
"or manage them manually with `ffi.gc()` or an explicit C `free` function, to"
" avoid memory leaks."
msgstr ""
"**谨慎管理 C 内存。** 注意 `ffi.new()` 的分配。对于频繁分配的大结构体，依赖 LuaJIT 的垃圾回收器，或用 `ffi.gc()`"
" 或显式的 C `free` 函数手动管理，以避免内存泄漏。"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:89 cb4c9a8ef63f4fc4b84c450b067cfdda
msgid "4. Advanced: Multi-Language FFI (lua-resty-ffi)"
msgstr "4. 进阶：跨语言 FFI（lua-resty-ffi）"

#: ../../14-ffi.md:91 a01dc044a2e24748be8ff7298acbf8be
msgid ""
"To move beyond C, the third-party [lua-resty-"
"ffi](https://github.com/urbanairship/lua-resty-ffi) provides a generic, non-"
"blocking API for hybrid programming. It uses Nginx thread pools to safely "
"offload heavy work to mainstream languages without blocking the primary "
"event loop:"
msgstr ""
"要突破 C 的限制，第三方 [lua-resty-ffi](https://github.com/urbanairship/lua-resty-ffi)"
" 为混合编程提供了通用的非阻塞 API。它利用 Nginx 线程池，把繁重工作安全地卸载给主流语言，而不阻塞主事件循环："

